{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And it grieved Him to His heart.</b> Rabbi Acha bar Rabbi Chanina said: When the Holy One, blessed be He, saw His world destroyed, as it were, He sat and mourned. Another interpretation: it refers to man — that He did not mourn, except over the heart of man, for he placed leaven in the dough, and said: 'I am the one who placed it; I am the one who made it,' as it is said: ״כי יצר לב האדם רע״."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:03.344981433Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}